msgid "Update"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Today, together with https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-20-0-released/"
"[Quarkus 3.20 LTS], we released Quarkus 3.21."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Whereas Quarkus 3.20 LTS is the direct continuation of Quarkus 3.19, Quarkus "
"3.21 comes with new features."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"It comes with a lot of small enhancements and the support for the TLS "
"Registry in the MongoDB Client extension."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To update to Quarkus 3.21, we recommend updating to the latest version of "
"the Quarkus CLI and run:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Note that `quarkus update` can update your applications from any version of "
"Quarkus (including 2.x) to Quarkus 3.21."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For more information about the adjustments you need to make to your "
"applications, please refer to the https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/"
"Migration-Guide-3.21[Quarkus 3.21 migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

msgid "TLS registry support for MongoDB Client"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We continue to deploy the TLS registry we included a while ago to centralize "
"and simplify the TLS configuration."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In this version, we added TLS registry support to the MongoDB Client "
"extension."
msgstr ""

msgid "Platform component upgrades"
msgstr ""

msgid "Quarkus CXF"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Quarkus CXF 3.21 was released and is now available in https://code.quarkus."
"io/?extension-search=origin:platform%20quarkus-cxf[Quarkus Platform 3.21].\n"
"Check the https://docs.quarkiverse.io/quarkus-cxf/dev/release-notes/3.21.0."
"html[Quarkus CXF 3.21.0] release notes for more information about what is "
"new in this release."
msgstr ""

msgid "Camel Quarkus"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Camel Quarkus has been upgraded to 3.20.0.\n"
"You can consult the https://camel.apache.org/releases/q-3.20.0/[release "
"notes] for more information."
msgstr ""

msgid "Amazon Services"
msgstr ""

msgid "The Amazon Services extensions have been upgraded to version 3.3.1."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get the full changelog of https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/3.21.0.CR1[3.21.0.CR1] and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/3.21.0[3.21.0] on GitHub."
msgstr ""

